{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-vision-methodology","title":"战略远见的方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/a-single-spark/application-significance/strategic-vision-methodology","wordCount":2015,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"战略远见的方法论\">战略远见的方法论</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把《星星之火，可以燎原》当作预言书来读，收获的只是结论；把它当作预测程序来读，收获的才是能力。信中那套判断流程——列矛盾清单、核对事件、估变化率、用方向性语言下结论——本质上是一套可以在任何领域复用的预见程序。本篇把它操作化为三步框架：先取基线率（这类局面通常如何演化），再找驱动力（什么在改变默认轨迹），最后设临界信号（出现什么证据就更新判断）。毛泽东 1930 年的判断之所以经得起检验，不是因为他看得远，而是因为他的程序对——这一点可以用现代预测科学的研究结果来交叉印证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;三步预见程序&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;第一步 外部视角:取基线率&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;第二步 驱动力分析:找变化率来源&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;第三步 临界信号:设定更新条件&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;回答:这类局面历史上多数怎么走&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;回答:什么力量在改变默认轨迹&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;回答:什么信号出现就修正判断&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;输出:方向性判断 + 可证伪的检验点&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"三步预见程序\"] --&gt; B[\"第一步 外部视角:取基线率\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"第二步 驱动力分析:找变化率来源\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"第三步 临界信号:设定更新条件\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"回答:这类局面历史上多数怎么走\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"回答:什么力量在改变默认轨迹\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"回答:什么信号出现就修正判断\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"输出:方向性判断 + 可证伪的检验点\"]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>盲目乐观 / 悲观</th>\n<th>程序化预见</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起点</td>\n<td>从结论出发找证据</td>\n<td>从基线率出发定锚点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据处理</td>\n<td>只收集支持性事实</td>\n<td>强制列出反向指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结论形式</td>\n<td>&quot;一定会 / 完蛋了&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;方向如何、何信号则修正&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>错了换说法继续</td>\n<td>错了回溯哪一步失灵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情绪角色</td>\n<td>判断的燃料</td>\n<td>判断的干扰项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>程序与直觉的分水岭在最后一行：预见能力高的人不是没有情绪，而是把情绪隔离在流程之外。这正是<a href=\"confidence-in-difficult-times\">困境中的信心与判断</a>要处理的问题——本篇先解决&quot;怎么判&quot;，下一篇解决&quot;凭什么信&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第一步-外部视角-先问这类局面通常怎么走\">第一步：外部视角——先问这类局面通常怎么走</h2><p>1930 年初的红军该参照什么基线？毛泽东的矛盾清单实际上完成了一次外部视角的构建：不问&quot;我们这次能不能行&quot;，而问&quot;统治集团陷入多线混战、农民问题无解的社会里，历史上通常发生什么&quot;。这种从参照类出发的思维方式，在决策科学中有明确的名字——外部视角（outside view）。心理学家丹尼尔·卡尼曼（2002 年诺贝尔经济学奖得主）与阿莫斯·特沃斯基的研究表明，人类默认使用内部视角：过度关注眼前案例的细节，忽视同类案例的统计结果；其著作《思考，快与慢》（2011）把这种&quot;所见即全部&quot;的认知偏差概括为 WYSIATI。</p>\n<p>外部视角的价值在于给乐观或悲观装上锚点。1930 年的基线是残酷的：此前十余年间中国境内的大规模武装反抗多以失败告终——这正是悲观论者的统计直觉。毛泽东的过人之处在于他没有否认基线，而是论证了本次案例与参照类存在系统性差异：军阀混战提供了俄国革命所没有的统治缝隙，土地革命提供了旧式民变所没有的组织纲领。修正基线而非无视基线——这是外部视角的正确用法，也是它与赌博式乐观的区别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第二步-驱动力分析-找变化率的来源\">第二步：驱动力分析——找变化率的来源</h2><p>有了基线，第二步是识别什么力量在改变默认轨迹。1930 年的信里，驱动力被具体化为四组矛盾及其对应事件；用现代语言说，毛泽东在估算革命力量的净增长率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>——土地革命每发动一批农民、敌方混战每消耗一批资源，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 就为正。燎原式扩散的数学形态是 S 型逻辑斯蒂曲线：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mi>K</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dN}{dt} = rN\\left(1 - \\frac{N}{K}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是革命力量规模，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是环境容量（可动员的人口与资源上限）。这个模型有两个常被忽视的含义：其一，扩散早期增长缓慢，多数观察者在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 尚小时误判趋势——这正是&quot;星星之火&quot;阶段被轻视的数学原因；其二，增长存在天花板 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>，忽视容量约束的扩张会把增长变成消耗。1930 年信中把江西选为&quot;高潮前夜&quot;的根据地，实际上是对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（矛盾激化程度）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>（可动员人口规模）做了一次联合评估；而后来第五次反&quot;围剿&quot;前的盲目扩红，则可视为越过容量约束的反例。驱动力分析的要义因此不是喊增长，而是回答两个问题：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 从哪来，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 在哪里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第三步-临界信号-把-快要到来-翻译成可证伪条件\">第三步：临界信号——把&quot;快要到来&quot;翻译成可证伪条件</h2><p>信中&quot;航船的桅杆、东方的朝日、母腹中的婴儿&quot;三个意象，用现代术语说就是高似然比的先导信号：它们在&quot;高潮将至&quot;的世界里出现的概率，远高于在&quot;高潮无望&quot;的世界里。贝叶斯更新公式给出了处理这类信号的规范方式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(H \\mid E) = \\frac{P(E \\mid H)\\, P(H)}{P(E)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即观察到信号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 后，用它在两种假设下的似然比来修正对假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的信心。毛泽东没有这个公式，但他做了等价的事：把判断与具体事件绑定——军阀混战升级、农民运动再起、敌军士气变化——任何一项变动都会改变他对节奏的估计。这与决策科学家菲利普·泰特洛克在《超预测》（2015）中总结的高手特征高度一致：用细粒度的中间事件持续更新判断，而不是一次性押注终局结论。现代预测竞赛（如&quot;良好判断计划&quot;对数千个地缘政治问题的十年追踪）证实：程序化更新能把预测准确度显著提升，且高于专家资历的贡献。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-三种伪远见\">反模式：三种伪远见</h2><p>三步框架的反面是三种常见伪远见，每一种都能在历史与现实中找到对应。第一种是叙事谬误：把随机序列事后编成&quot;必然如此&quot;的故事——对 1930 年信的某些解读只讲 1949 年应验、不讲长征前挫折，就是把预测程序神化为先知能力。第二种是时刻表承诺：把方向判断硬化为日期承诺，立三路线 1930 年强令攻打大城市即是把&quot;高潮&quot;从趋势语言篡改为时刻表的后果，其代价由根据地军民承担。第三种是把愿望当证据：用渴望的结果反推其必然性，检验方法是强制列出&quot;什么证据出现就承认自己错了&quot;——列不出证伪条件的乐观，无论多么雄辩，都应降级为愿望。</p>\n<p>三种伪远见共享同一个病根：流程缺了某一步。缺外部视角则情绪定锚，缺驱动力分析则空喊方向，缺临界信号则错误无法被纠正。对照检查自己任何一次长期判断——投资、职业、组织战略——缺哪步补哪步，是本篇最直接的用法；判断之后的信心如何维持而不滑向固执，见<a href=\"confidence-in-difficult-times\">困境中的信心与判断</a>；这套程序在 1930 年文本中的原始形态，可回看<a href=\"../text-analysis/revolutionary-situation-assessment\">革命形势判断方法</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>《星星之火，可以燎原》的真正遗产是预见程序而非预言结论：基线率、驱动力、临界信号三步缺一不可</li>\n<li>外部视角要求先取参照类基线，再论证本次案例的系统性差异——修正基线而非无视基线</li>\n<li>逻辑斯蒂曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mi>K</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dN}{dt} = rN(1 - \\frac{N}{K})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 提示两个要点：早期趋势易被低估，容量约束不可越过</li>\n<li>&quot;桅杆、朝日、婴儿&quot;是高似然比先导信号的诗意表达，其现代对应是贝叶斯式持续更新</li>\n<li>三种伪远见（叙事谬误、时刻表承诺、愿望当证据）分别对应流程三步骤的缺失</li>\n<li>程序解决&quot;怎么判&quot;，信心解决&quot;凭什么信&quot;——后者由下一篇展开</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"战略远见的方法论","id":"战略远见的方法论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"第一步：外部视角——先问这类局面通常怎么走","id":"第一步-外部视角-先问这类局面通常怎么走"},{"level":2,"text":"第二步：驱动力分析——找变化率的来源","id":"第二步-驱动力分析-找变化率的来源"},{"level":2,"text":"第三步：临界信号——把\"快要到来\"翻译成可证伪条件","id":"第三步-临界信号-把-快要到来-翻译成可证伪条件"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：三种伪远见","id":"反模式-三种伪远见"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"农村根据地战略构想","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/a-single-spark/text-analysis/rural-base-area-strategy"},"next":{"title":"困境中的信心与判断","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/a-single-spark/application-significance/confidence-in-difficult-times"}}